{"entry":{"id":"l-f6f8e55e4806177f","lemma":"كَفَرَ","root":"كفر","arabic":"فَكَفَرُوا۟","gloss":"But they disbelieved","transliteration":"fakafarū","representativeKey":"37:170:1","exampleKeys":["37:170:1","84:22:3","88:23:4"],"occurrenceCount":289,"courseOrder":35,"sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"],"rootId":"r-abff0adc9ab3f548","approval":{"status":"pending"}},"examples":[{"ref":"37:170","tokens":[{"key":"37:170:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَكَفَرُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"But they disbelieved","transliteration":"fakafarū","lemma":"كَفَرَ","root":"كفر","entryId":"l-f6f8e55e4806177f"},{"key":"37:170:2","position":2,"arabic":"بِهِۦ ۖ","kind":"word","gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"37:170:3","position":3,"arabic":"فَسَوْفَ","kind":"word","gloss":"so soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","lemma":"سَوْف","root":null,"entryId":"l-0e28987d8e8dbefa"},{"key":"37:170:4","position":4,"arabic":"يَعْلَمُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"they will know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","lemma":"عَلِمَ","root":"علم","entryId":"l-6de9979b254804ea"},{"key":"37:170:5","position":5,"arabic":"١٧٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"But (now that the Qur’ân has come) they disbelieve therein (i.e. in the Qur’ân and in Prophet Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم , and all that he brought, - the Divine Revelation), so they will come to know!","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"See the footnote (A) of (V.3:85).","ref":null}],"targetKey":"37:170:1","targetGloss":"But they disbelieved","targetTransliteration":"fakafarū","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"84:22","tokens":[{"key":"84:22:1","position":1,"arabic":"بَلِ","kind":"word","gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bali","lemma":"بَل","root":null,"entryId":"l-706f9c6eca0445cc"},{"key":"84:22:2","position":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"84:22:3","position":3,"arabic":"كَفَرُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","lemma":"كَفَرَ","root":"كفر","entryId":"l-f6f8e55e4806177f"},{"key":"84:22:4","position":4,"arabic":"يُكَذِّبُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"deny","transliteration":"yukadhibūna","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","root":"كذب","entryId":"l-db86b0654d661fb2"},{"key":"84:22:5","position":5,"arabic":"٢٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"Nay, those who disbelieve belie (Prophet Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم and whatever he brought, i.e. this Qur’ân and Islâmic Monotheism, etc.).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"It is obligatory to have Belief in the Messengership of the Prophet (Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم). Narrated Abu Hurairah رضي الله عنه : Allâh’s Messenger صلى الله عليه وسلم said: \"By Him (Allâh) in Whose Hand Muhammad’s soul is, there is none from amongst the Jews and Christians (of these present nations) who hears about me and then dies without believing in the Message with which I have been sent (i.e. Islâmic Monotheism), but he will be from the dwellers of the (Hell) Fire.\" (Sahih Muslim, the Book of Faith, Vol. 1, Chapter No.240). See also (V.3:85) and (V.3:116).","ref":null}],"targetKey":"84:22:3","targetGloss":"disbelieved","targetTransliteration":"kafarū","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"88:23","tokens":[{"key":"88:23:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِلَّا","kind":"word","gloss":"But","transliteration":"illā","lemma":"إِلَّا","root":null,"entryId":"l-250ca4d5b58814dd"},{"key":"88:23:2","position":2,"arabic":"مَن","kind":"word","gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","lemma":"مِن","root":null,"entryId":"l-9235e02e84a628b3"},{"key":"88:23:3","position":3,"arabic":"تَوَلَّىٰ","kind":"word","gloss":"turns away","transliteration":"tawallā","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","root":"ولي","entryId":"l-f32564c74acc4226"},{"key":"88:23:4","position":4,"arabic":"وَكَفَرَ","kind":"word","gloss":"and disbelieves","transliteration":"wakafara","lemma":"كَفَرَ","root":"كفر","entryId":"l-f6f8e55e4806177f"},{"key":"88:23:5","position":5,"arabic":"٢٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"Save the one who turns away and disbelieves.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"See footnote of (V.8:39).","ref":{"surah":8,"ayah":39}}],"targetKey":"88:23:4","targetGloss":"and disbelieves","targetTransliteration":"wakafara","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]}]}